Author: Rafael Amichis Luengo (Madrid). Method: Degtyarev-Shimada (arXiv:1405.4683 S5).
char-p: CRT block split of F_p[t]/phi = A x B (phi = (t-1)^a * g^b). Blocks reduced one at a
